Package: GSE280465
Type: Package
Title: EPICv2 Methylation ExperimentHub Data from GEO
Version: 0.99.1
Authors@R: person("Paul", "Ruiz", role = c("aut", "cre"),
            email = "ruizpint@qut.edu.au",
            comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0007-6714-3566"))
Description: Provides ExperimentHub access to a processed DNA methylation
    resource derived from GEO accession GSE280465. The resource contains adult
    Illumina Infinium MethylationEPIC version 2 data from 163 samples across
    four tissue types, represented as a RangedSummarizedExperiment with beta,
    M, and CN assays, hg38 genomic ranges, and sample phenotype metadata.
URL: https://github.com/paulYRP/GSE280465
BugReports: https://github.com/paulYRP/GSE280465/issues
License: Artistic-2.0
Depends:
    R (>= 4.4.0)
Imports:
    ExperimentHub,
    utils
Suggests:
    BiocStyle,
    ExperimentHubData,
    knitr,
    rmarkdown,
    SummarizedExperiment,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
VignetteBuilder: knitr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
biocViews: ExperimentData, ExperimentHub, GEO, Homo_sapiens_Data,
    MethylationArrayData, MicroarrayData, Tissue
Encoding: UTF-8
